        "eyebrow": "The Cacao Guide · Part 06 of 10",
        "title": "Why Chuncho Is Different",
        "deck": "The genetics, the history, the flavor, the rarity, and why this one bean from the Peruvian Andes is unlike anything else you can put in your cup.",
        "meta_read": "12 Min Read",
        "meta_topic": "Origin &amp; Genetics",
        "leaf_url": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0725/1188/1261/files/learn-img-a044820100.png?v=1785782948"
